          guideText: `{name}, the Middle East is one of the most covered and most misunderstood regions in the world. Before we examine specific conflicts, you need context: what the region actually is geographically and historically, how external powers shaped it, and how its internal dynamics work. This lesson builds that foundation so the cases that follow make sense.`,
